        "original_id": "98f4f282-f9cb-5239-b0db-40998aa64f63",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Warwick, Matt Lucena, Ilie Năstase, Steve Siegel, Meredith McGrath, Kimberly Po\n- Events: Cedar Grove Open, 1980 Australian Open, 1996 US Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players, defending champions\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Warwick was born on 8 April 1952 and is an Australian former professional male tennis player.\n- Kim Warwick competed on the ATP Tour from 1970 to 1987.\n- Kim Warwick reached the singles final of the Australian Open in 1980.\n- Matt Lucena was born on August 4, 1969 and is a former professional tennis player from the United States.\n- At the Cedar Grove Open, Ilie Năstase won the singles title.\n- At the Cedar Grove Open, Kim Warwick and Steve Siegel won the doubles title as partners.\n- Meredith McGrath and Matt Lucena were the defending champions for the 1996 US Open mixed doubles event.\n- In the 1996 US Open mixed doubles event, Matt Lucena competed with Kimberly Po, while Meredith McGrath did not compete.",
